# docs/*.md is tracked (decided 2026-09-22), and docs/images/ too
# (2026-11-12) so the pages show their screenshots on GitHub - the
# release notes link docs/*.md there before a page is on the website.
# Everything else in here (videos, the WordPress autoindex script)
# stays untracked, a staging area for pasting into the WordPress site.
docs/*
!docs/*.md
!docs/images/
docs/images/Thumbs.db
